OL,3,GNEWSABin strike deal could be signed
OL,4,Awithin weeks, council leader says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of Birmingham City Council
OL,7,Fhas said he hopes an agreement to end
OL,8,Fthe city's long-running bin strike
OL,9,Fcould be signed off within weeks.
OL,11,FLiberal Democrat Roger Harmer was
OL,12,Fresponding to questions from listeners
OL,13,Fon BBC Radio WM's Hot Seat.
OL,15,FHe said the council and the Unite trade
OL,16,Funion had agreed a proposal to end the
OL,17,Fdispute, but several stages of approval
OL,18,Fwere still needed before it could be
OL,19,Fsigned off "late September or early
OL,20,FOctober".
